<div class="mx-auto max-w-sm mt-10">
  <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-lg px-8 pt-6 pb-8 mb-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-center text-gray-800 mb-2">이메일 인증</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-center text-gray-600 mb-6">
      아래 버튼을 클릭하면 이메일 인증이 완료됩니다.
    </p>

    <form action={~p"/users/confirm/#{@token}"} method="post">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" value={get_csrf_token()}>
      <button type="submit" class="w-full inline-flex justify-center items-center rounded-md border border-transparent bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-indigo-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:ring-offset-2">
        이메일 인증 완료
      </button>
    </form>

    <p class="text-center text-sm text-gray-600 mt-4">
      링크가 만료되었나요?
      <.link navigate={~p"/users/confirm"} class="font-semibold text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">
        재발송 요청
      </.link>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
